# GitHub language detection overrides
go.sum linguist-generated

# Force LF for anything that runs inside the Linux container, regardless of
# the checkout platform's core.autocrlf. Without this, a Windows checkout
# (autocrlf=true, the Git-for-Windows default) silently rewrites
# entrypoint.sh to CRLF, and the container fails at startup with
# "exec /usr/local/bin/entrypoint.sh: no such file or directory" - the
# classic symptom of a CRLF-mangled shebang line, not a missing file.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
